{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"中交路南-出差考勤管理","content":"(function () {\r\n    //获取当前用户\r\n    var user = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n    var doc = $.context.getCurrentDocument();\r\n    //应用Id\r\n    var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n\r\n    //获取本月度\r\n    var now = $.date.getCurrentDate();        //当前日期       \r\n    var nowMonth = now.getMonth();           //当前月     \r\n    var nowYear = now.getYear() + 1900;\r\n    var mongthdays = getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth);//本月天数\r\n\r\n    var monthstartdate = getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth);  //本月起始日期\r\n    var monthEndDate = getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays);//本月结束日期\r\n\r\n    var date = monthstartdate.getTime();\r\n    var date1 = monthEndDate.getTime();\r\n\r\n    //接收用户id集合\r\n    var receiveUserIds = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n    //发送站内信\r\n    $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"11\", date, receiveUserIds);\r\n\r\n    // \"1667232000\");//大于等于\r\n    //     var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"le\", \"1669737600\")\r\n    //表单名称\r\n    var formName = \"外出审批单\";\r\n    //控件值键对\r\n    var filterParamList = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"姓名\", \"eq\",user);\r\n    var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"ge\", date);//大于等于\r\n    var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"lt\", date1);//小于\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam1);\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam2);\r\n    filterParamList.add(filterParam3);\r\n    var docS = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName, filterParamList);\r\n\r\n    $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"token\", docS.size(), $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    if (docS != null) {\r\n        if (docS.size() > 6 || docS.size() == 6) {\r\n            //获取默认校验信息集合\r\n            var message = $.validate.create();\r\n            message.addError(\"校验失败\");\r\n            //返回默认校验信息集合\r\n            return message;\r\n        } else {\r\n            return \"\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\n})()\r\n//获得本月的开始日期     \r\nfunction getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n    var monthStartDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, 1);\r\n    //转格式\r\n    var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n    //获取日期字符串\r\n    var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthStartDate0, format);\r\n    var monthStartDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n    return monthStartDate;\r\n}\r\n\r\n//获得本月的结束日期     \r\nfunction getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays) {\r\n    var monthEndDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays);\r\n    //转格式\r\n    var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n    //获取日期字符串\r\n    var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthEndDate0, format);\r\n    var monthEndDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n    return monthEndDate;\r\n}\r\n\r\n//获取本月总共天数\r\nfunction getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n\r\n    var endday = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth + 1, 0);\r\n\r\n    return endday.getDate();\r\n\r\n} ","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"db8f28b87eb34470aa340c09ccad2ab3","id":"c624fb4b4a7b49a3ae908802958638bc","modelCode":"","modelId":"a15a7a1ad54248f5a6ac70972361509f","modelType":"PC_BUSINESS_DESIGN","namespace":"gas","path":"外出审批单列表","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versions":0.0}